      <string id="P_hotkeys_toggle_watcher">Shortcut: Toggle clipboard watcher</string>
      <string id="P_hotkeys_toggle_watcher_Help">Key combination such as Ctrl+Alt+P. Empty: no shortcut.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: hotkeys.toggle_watcher</string>
